  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 200eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons without a Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild</p>\n<p><em>A basic visual-spectrum beam emitter, boosting natural accuracy, but tends to interfere with laser-based smartlink targeting software.</em></p>\n<p>Can be activated/deactivated as an Action. While active, the Weapon functions as Excellent Quality, but the user takes a -2 to Stealth Checks, or -4 against characters utilizing Infrared Nightvision Scopes, LL/IR/UV Cyberware, or equivalents. Poor Quality weapons with an active Laser Sight still jam when rolling a Critical Failure (1).</p>\n<p>If the weapon is already Excellent Quality, the user may take an Action (or do so as part of a Ranged Attack Action) to direct the active laser at a target. Until the start of the user’s next Turn, anyone whom can see the laser gains a +1 Complementary Bonus to Ranged Attacks against the lased target. Incompatible with IR/UV Laser Sight.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to LordChesusCrust for the basis of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
